46 1Q31 1 31 10Q31 14 34 26T39 40Q41 46 62 46Q130 49 150 85Q154 91 221 362L289 634Q287 635 234 637Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMATHI-4F\" d=\"M740 435Q740 320 676 213T511 42T304 -22Q207 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435ZM637 476Q637 565 591 615T476 665Q396 665 322 605Q242 542 200 428T157 216Q157 126 200 73T314 19Q404 19 485 98T608 313Q637 408 637 476Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-AF\" d=\"M69 544V590H430V544H69Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(24,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMATHI-4E\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMATHI-4F\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,521)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"-70\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(35.509069263633876,0) scale(4.471691980721199,1)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-AF\"></use>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"1905\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"1701\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>The trigonometric ratio that relates the opposite leg to the hypotenuse is <em>sine</em>. Hence,\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"30.079ex\" height=\"24.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -11.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -5455.7 12950.5 10409.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmen